<title>HUNGARY: FORECAST- Hungary T-bill yields seen moving little.</title>
<headline>FORECAST- Hungary T-bill yields seen moving little.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's discount Treasury-bill yields were expected to be set at close around last week's levels at this week's auctions, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Government Debt Management Agency will auction one-month T-bills on Tuesday, three-month bills on Wednesday, six-month bills on Thursday and 12-month bills on Friday.</p>
<p>		  ONE-MONTH   THREE-MONTH   SIX-MONTH    12-MONTH</p>
<p> Bills offered     1	     5	     14	    15</p>
<p>(HUF billion)</p>
<p>Average yield at</p>
<p>  last auction   21.55	 20.85	  20.68	 20.45</p>
<p>Valid bid</p>
<p>    range    19.55-22.55  18.85-21.35  18.68-21.18  18.45-20.95</p>
<p>FORECASTS OF HUNGARIAN DEALERS</p>
<p>Istvan Halasz/Bank Austria-GiroCredit</p>
<p>    AVERAGE	21.50	 21.00	  20.75	 20.50</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	22.10	 21.20	  21.10	 20.60</p>
<p>Gyula Kerdo/Creditanstalt Securities</p>
<p>    AVERAGE	21.70	 20.93	  20.83	 20.67</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	22.11	 21.18	  21.05	 20.92</p>
<p>Zsolt Bango/Gog Securities</p>
<p>    AVERAGE	21.40	 20.80	  20.55	 20.50</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	21.65	 21.00	  20.80	 20.65</p>
<p>Robert Keszei/Daiwa-MKB</p>
<p>    AVERAGE	21.60	 20.82	  20.65	 20.46</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	21.80	 21.08	  20.78	 20.53</p>
<p>-- Sandor Peto, Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
